    gateway -->|/api/v1/reviews| review
    gateway -->|/api/v1/recommendations| recommendation
    gateway -->|PUT /api/v1/admin/stock/sku| inventory
    cart -->|prices by SKU| catalog
    order -->|checkout snapshot| cart
